            "features": [
                "The ‘Himalayas’ is a Sanskrit word which means the 'abode of snow'.",
                "The Himalayas stretch from Jammu and Kashmir and Ladakh in the north to Arunachal Pradesh in the east.",
                "The Himalayas protect the country from the cold winds coming from the north.",
                "The Himalayas have three ranges running parallel to each other:",
                "1) the Himadri or the Greater Himalayas",
                "2) the Himachal or the Middle Himalayas and",
                "3) the Shiwalik or the Outer Himalayas."
